! XRT-13 CE3(IOL 17.15)= 顧客 D の CE(拠点 3)。据え付け(学ぶ側は変更しない)。サービスごとのサブインタフェース。
interface {{ links[0] }}
 description to PE (provider)
 no ip address
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[0] }}.310
 description L3VPN (provider VRF CUST-D)
 encapsulation dot1Q 310
 ip address 172.20.3.1 255.255.255.0
!
interface Loopback300
 description site 3 LAN
 ip address 10.30.3.1 255.255.255.0
!
interface {{ links[0] }}.320
 description E-Line to the other site
 encapsulation dot1Q 320
 ip address 172.31.32.3 255.255.255.0
!
interface {{ links[0] }}.330
 description E-LAN (VPLS)
 encapsulation dot1Q 330
 ip address 172.31.33.3 255.255.255.0
!
interface {{ links[0] }}.340
 description E-LAN (EVPN)
 encapsulation dot1Q 340
 ip address 172.31.34.3 255.255.255.0
!
! 拠点 3 の CE は BGP を話さない。プロバイダへの既定経路だけ
ip route 0.0.0.0 0.0.0.0 172.20.3.254
!
